[en.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY]
Giggle at Ghosty

[en.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY_desc]
As the final political reforms came to a close, the Rock Farm was no longer the backward and desolate place it had been two years earlier. Whatever the future held, the Pie family and the ponies of this land would face it with hope. Wherever Pinkie Pie might be, if she could still see this land, she would surely take heart.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY]
对着妖魔大笑

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GIGGLE_AT_GHOSTY_desc]
随着最后的政治改革收尾，采石农场将不再是两年前那个落后又荒凉的地方了。无论未来发生什么，派家族和这块土地上的小马都将积极面对。无论萍琪派如今身在何处，如果她还能看见这片土地，她一定会感到欣慰的。

